#: managermodule.cpp:40
msgid "No support for HAL on this system"
msgstr "Dit Systeem ünnerstütt keen HAL"

#: managermodule.cpp:47
msgid "No support for CD polling on this system"
msgstr "Dit Systeem ünnerstütt dat Affragen vun CDs nich."

#: notifiermodule.cpp:51
msgid "All Mime Types"
msgstr "All MIME-Typen"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file managermoduleview.ui line 24
#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "Enable HAL backend"
msgstr "HAL bruken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file managermoduleview.ui line 27
#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"Select this if you want to enable the Hardware Abstraction Layer (http://hal."
"freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/hal) support."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du de Ünnerstütten för de HAL (Hardware Abstraction "
"Layer) anmaken wullt (http://hal.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/hal)."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file managermoduleview.ui line 35
#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Enable CD polling"
msgstr "CD-Affraag anmaken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file managermoduleview.ui line 38
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Select this to enable the CD polling."
msgstr "Aktiveert dat Affragen vun CDs."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file managermoduleview.ui line 46
#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Enable medium application autostart after mount"
msgstr "Medien-Programmen na't Inhangen automaatsch starten"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file managermoduleview.ui line 49
#: rc.cpp:18
msgid ""
"Select this if you want to enable application autostart after mounting a "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt Programmen na dat Inhangen vun Reedschappen vun alleen "
"starten."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file notifiermoduleview.ui line 48
#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Medium types:"
msgstr "Medientypen:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file notifiermoduleview.ui line 64
#: rc.cpp:24
msgid ""
"Here is the list of the availables type of medium which can be monitored. "
"You can filter the availables action by selecting a kind of medium. If you "
"want to see all the actions, select \"All Mime Types\"."
msgstr ""
"Hier is de List vun verföögbor Medientypen, de beluert warrn köönt. Du "
"kannst de verföögboren Akschonen ingrenzen, wenn Du en Medientyp utsöchst. "
"Wenn Du all Akschonen ankieken wullt, klick op \"All MIME-Typen\"."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file notifiermoduleview.ui line 90
#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "&Add..."
msgstr "&Tofögen..."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file notifiermoduleview.ui line 93
#: rc.cpp:30
msgid "Click here to add an action."
msgstr "Klick hier, wenn Du en Akschoon tofögen wullt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file notifiermoduleview.ui line 101
#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "&Delete"
msgstr "&Wegdoon"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file notifiermoduleview.ui line 104
#: rc.cpp:36
msgid "Click here to delete the selected action if possible."
msgstr ""
"Klick hier, wenn Du de utsöchte Akschoon wegdoon wullt (nich jümmers "
"mööglich)."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file notifiermoduleview.ui line 112
#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "&Edit..."
msgstr "&Bewerken..."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file notifiermoduleview.ui line 115
#: rc.cpp:42
msgid "Click here to edit the selected action if possible."
msgstr ""
"Klick hier, wenn Du de utsöchte Akschoon bewerken wullt (nich jümmers "
"mööglich)."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file notifiermoduleview.ui line 123
#: rc.cpp:45
msgid "&Toggle as Auto Action"
msgstr "As au&tom. Akschoon an-/utmaken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file notifiermoduleview.ui line 126
#: rc.cpp:48
msgid ""
"Click here to perform automaticly this action on detection of the selected "
"medium type (this option is disabled when \"All Mime Types\" is selected)."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du wullt, dat disse Akschoon jümmers bi't Opdecken vun den "
"utsöchten Mediumtyp utföhrt warrt (nich verföögbor, wenn \"All MIME-Typen\" "
"utsöcht is)."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file notifiermoduleview.ui line 153
#: rc.cpp:51
msgid ""
"Here is the list of the available actions. You can modify them by using the "
"buttons on your right."
msgstr ""
"Dit is de List vun verföögbor Akschonen. Du kannst se mit de Knööp rechts "
"bewerken."

